{"version":1,"key":"card:694","content":{"id":694,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑这样一个场景：你依赖了 A，而 A 依赖了 B。突然 B 被发现存在 bug 或者安全隐患，需要升级。但是 B 不是你直接依赖的，你只能等待 A 的维护者发布新版，这其中的等待时间完全不可控。所以如果能有一种方式直接修改 B 的版本就好了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm.overrides","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就可以来解决这个问题，它可以用来直接指定依赖的版本号。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm.overrides","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以写在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"package.json","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，也可以写在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm-workspace.yaml","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中。当写在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm-workspace.yaml","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，会对 monorepo 中的所有 workspace 生效，基本语法如下："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"包名\": \"版本号\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"a7267b94-224e-4a09-af8d-d08fe7831162","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以下是常见用法："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​覆盖所有版本"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"lodash\": \"4.17.21\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"89444515-34a4-411d-9b02-77a0ca780164","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"key 直接写包名 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示替换所有依赖树中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"value","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 写精确版本号 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"4.17.21","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所有地方的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都会被统一替换为这个版本，适用于统一依赖池中的某个包。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​覆盖指定依赖"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"foo>bar\": \"2.0.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"99ff14f0-fb9e-4488-8e0b-f954e40b9343","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":">","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 符号指定嵌套依赖，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"foo>bar","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"foo","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 依赖的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"bar","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。这样只会替换 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"foo","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 依赖下的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"bar","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其他地方的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"bar","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不受影响。支持的嵌套层级不限，例如覆盖 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"foo → bar → baz","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条依赖链中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"baz","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以这样写："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"foo>bar>baz\": \"1.0.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"af3c138d-b12f-4da5-a2ff-6433dcb91fbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​通配符覆盖"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"*>react\": \"18.2.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"2296e2c6-6f88-420c-96a0-3159c20173f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":" * "},{"type":"formatted","text":"通配符"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"，*>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示匹配任意包。无论是谁依赖了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"react","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，都会被统一替换为 18.2.0。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​本地路径覆盖"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"some-package\": \"file:../local-dev/some-package\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"8a1b4ef3-75f8-4416-b13d-18a44f796bb6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"value 使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"file:","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 协议指定本地包路径。这种用法常见于两种场景："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调试本地开发的包时，使用本地路径覆盖进行测试"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"魔改了某个已有包但没有发布到 npm，而是存放在本地仓库中，通过本地路径覆盖即可直接使用修改后的版本，无需改动源码中的包引用。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​Git 地址覆盖"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"some-package\": \"github:username/repo#branch\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"a891cae0-3fc8-4188-bb72-764aa18274ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"或者指定具体的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"#commit","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"#tag","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"some-package\": \"git+https://github.com/username/repo.git#v1.0.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"9c6376e0-e11f-4781-a0a5-42deaef8dbc6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种方式在需要临时试用某个包的不同分支或者未发布版本时非常有用，比如你正在和 A 包的维护者协作修复一个 bug，他让你测试他的 PR，你就可以用 Git 地址覆盖的方式直接指向那个 PR 分支。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","text":"overrides","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 互相引用"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"lodash\": \"4.17.21\",\n      \"foo\": \"$lodash\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"0b7e8bc2-09a5-4786-8c53-962e0096a25d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"value","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"$","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 符号可以引用其他 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"overrides","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"$lodash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示引用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对应的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"value","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（即 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"4.17.21","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"），这样 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"foo","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的版本也会是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"4.17.21","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。这种写法常见于以下场景："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"统一多个包的版本：当你希望项目中多个包的版本保持一致时，可以先定义一个基准版本，然后其他包引用它。比如项目中有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash-es","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，希望它们版本一致，可以这样写："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"lodash\": \"4.17.21\",\n      \"lodash-es\": \"$lodash\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"7621b292-345d-4ae4-94af-379342397f04","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"后续只需要修改 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的版本，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"lodash-es","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会自动跟随更新，避免手动维护多个版本号。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"简化重复配置：如果某个版本号很长或者来自特殊来源（如 Git 地址），可以在一个地方定义，后续引用即可，减少重复书写。例如某个包使用了 Git 地址覆盖："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"react\": \"github:facebook/react#my-feature-branch\",\n      \"react-dom\": \"$react\"\n    }\n  }\n}","uuid":"5ecf1935-a4cd-4a73-a03c-e327e6fe3e1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这样 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"react","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"react-dom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都会指向同一个分支。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","title":"不可滥用 pnpm.overrides","calloutType":"warning","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"overrides","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 很好用，但强行修改版本号可能导致不兼容的情况，比如你覆盖了 A 包依赖的 B 版本从 1.0 升级到 2.0，但 A 包可能是针对 B 1.0 的 API 设计的，更新后可能会出现运行时错误。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"overrides","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 主要存在以下风险："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​破坏兼容性"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"强制覆盖版本可能导致依赖包无法正常工作，被覆盖的包可能依赖特定版本的 API"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"隐藏问题"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"覆盖版本可能掩盖真正的依赖问题，建议优先联系上游包作者修复"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"维护成本"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要持续关注被覆盖的包是否已经修复，及时移除不必要的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"overrides","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}]}],"tags":["包管理器/pnpm"],"createTime":1775550889372,"updateTime":1775623657882,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775623657882}}